Package: bboxai-desktop
Version: VERSION_PLACEHOLDER
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Zainal Abidin <zainalabidin@unimap.edu.my>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-venv, python3-pip, curl, openssl, postgresql, nginx, libgl1, libglib2.0-0
Description: bboxAI desktop — local image/video annotation + YOLOv8 training
 Installs bbox-api (FastAPI backend) and a pre-built bbox-web UI as
 systemd-managed services on this machine, fronted by nginx. Local UI at
 http://bboxai:8080 once installed. Away-from-home access can be enabled
 afterward with bboxai-enable-remote.
